#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Ba ka da izinin amfani da na'urar wannan rukunin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Suna: wani rukuni daban yana amfani da wannan sunan tuni."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Ba a adana rukunin ba: wani daban ya canza shi tun lokacin da aka buɗe fom ɗin, ko kuma rubutawa ta gaza. Sake buɗe shi ka maimaita canjin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "An adana rukunin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ba a canza yanayin rukunin ba: rubutawa ta gaza. Duba rajistar Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "An share rukunin da ajiyayyen hoton bayanansa. An riƙe na'urarsa da jadawalansa. Ba a tuntuɓi mai tsara aiki ba."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "An ƙirƙiri na'urar da jadawalanta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ba a ƙirƙiri na'urar ba: rukunin yana da na'ura tuni, wani daban ya canza shi tun lokacin da aka buɗe shafin, ko kuma Cacti ya ƙi shi. Duba rajistar Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "An haɗa rukunin zuwa na'urar."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Ba a haɗa rukunin ba: na'urar ba ta wanzu ba, ba a ba ka izini a kanta ba, tana ɗauke da wani rukuni daban tuni, ko kuma wani daban ya canza rukunin tun lokacin da aka buɗe shafin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "An ƙara jadawalan da suka ɓace."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Ba a ƙara wani jadawali ba: rukunin ba shi da na'ura, ko kuma na'urarsa ba ta wanzu a yanzu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Ba a raba haɗin rukunin ba: wani daban ya canza shi tun lokacin da aka buɗe shafin."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "An raba haɗin rukunin. An riƙe na'urar da jadawalanta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "An sake tsara fihirisar ɓangarorin daga hoton bayanan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Ba a sake tsara fihirisar ɓangarorin ba: an kashe na'urar ko ba ta samuwa, saboda haka Cacti ya tsallake binciken bayananta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ba a sake tsara fihirisar ɓangarorin ba: Cacti bai iya gudanar da binciken bayanan ba. Duba rajistar Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Ba a sake tsara fihirisar ɓangarorin ba: ba a girka binciken bayanan HPC Scheduler ba. Girka samfuran daga shafin lafiya."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Ba a sake tsara fihirisar ɓangarorin ba: rukunin ba shi da na'ura, ko kuma na'urarsa ba ta wanzu a yanzu."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "An girka samfuran HPC Scheduler."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Ba a girka samfuran ba: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Duban sa ido"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Ba a iya karanta abubuwan da aka lura ba. Nemi mai gudanarwa ya duba rajistar plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Duba nau'ikan dalilan jira da sabuntar hoton bayanai a taƙaitaccen bayani. Miƙa batun bayanan tantancewa, haɗin rukuni da ƙa'idar gyara ga mai gudanarwa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Suna: yi amfani da haruffa, lambobi, ɗigo, dogon layi, ko layin ƙasa daga 1 zuwa 64, farawa da harafi ko lamba."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin pollers da aka jera."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Tazarar Tattara Bayanai: shigar da cikakkun daƙiƙoƙi daga %d zuwa %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Hanyar Isarwa: zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin hanyoyin isarwar da aka jera."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: shigar da cikakkiyar hanya, ko a bar shi babu komai domin amfani da saitin tsoho na mai tattara bayanai."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: wannan sunan mai masauki da tasha (port) ba sa cikin jerin masu masauki na slurmrestd a Saituna."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: shigar da https:// URL ba tare da sunan mai amfani, tambaya, ko guntu ba; ana karɓar http:// na yau da kullum ga adireshin loopback kaɗai."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Mai Amfani da slurmrestd: yi amfani da haruffa, lambobi, ɗigo, dogon layi, ko layin ƙasa da ba su wuce 64 ba, ko a bar shi babu komai domin alamar sirri (token) ta mai amfani."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Alamar Sirri: shigar da cikakkiyar hanyar fayil ɗin alamar sirri (token) a kan mai tattara bayanai. Ba a taɓa shigar da alamar sirrin kanta a nan ba."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Alamar Sirri: ba a saita kowace jagorar fayil ɗin alamar sirri ba tukuna. Nemi mai gudanarwa na Cacti ya saita su ƙarƙashin Saituna, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Alamar Sirri: dole ne fayil ɗin ya kasance a cikin ɗaya daga cikin jagororin fayil ɗin alamar sirri da aka saita a Saituna (%s)."

