#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Umurnan abokin ciniki suna amfani da fayilolin shiri da aka saita ƙarƙashin Saituna > HPC Scheduler da kuma tantancewar Slurm ta mai amfani da mai tattara bayanai; hanyar slurm.conf ta zaɓi tana zaɓar rukuni. Ana amfani da filayen slurmrestd tare da wannan hanyar isarwa kaɗai. Dole ne fayil ɗin alamar sirri ya zama mai karantuwa ga mai amfani da mai tattara bayanai kaɗai; plugin ɗin yana karanta shi a kowane gudu kuma ba ya taɓa adana alamar sirrin."

