msgid "%d partition graphs, %d for each partition, each with its own data source."
msgstr "Jadawalan ɓangarori %d, %d ga kowane ɓangare, kowanne da nasa tushen bayanai."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "In all: %d data sources and %d RRD files, and %d script server calls per poll. Partitions added later get graphs from the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Gabaɗaya: tushen bayanai %d da fayilolin RRD %d, da kiraye-kirayen script server %d a kowane tattarawa. Ɓangarorin da aka ƙara daga baya suna samun jadawalai daga shafin Sabbin Jadawalai."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the HPC Scheduler plugin for cluster %s. Its values come from the plugin snapshot; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Plugin ɗin HPC Scheduler ya ƙirƙira don rukuni %s. Ƙimominsa sun fito ne daga hoton bayanan plugin ɗin; sunan mai masauki suna ne keɓaɓɓe wanda ba a taɓa tuntuɓa ba."

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "configuration: a path, URL, or setting is missing or not allowed"
msgstr "saiti: hanya, URL, ko saiti ya ɓace ko ba a yarda da shi ba"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the scheduler could not be reached"
msgstr "ba a iya isa ga mai tsara aiki ba"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the call took longer than allowed and was stopped"
msgstr "kiran ya ɗauki lokaci fiye da yadda aka yarda kuma an dakatar da shi"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the answer was larger than allowed and was discarded"
msgstr "amsar ta fi girman da aka yarda kuma an jefar da ita"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the answer could not be parsed with the pinned data parser"
msgstr "ba a iya fassara amsar da mai fassara bayanan da aka manna ba"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the scheduler refused the credential"
msgstr "mai tsara aiki ya ƙi bayanan tantancewar"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the scheduler account may not see this data (PrivateData or permissions)"
msgstr "asusun mai tsara aiki ba zai iya ganin waɗannan bayanan ba (PrivateData ko izini)"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the controller asked clients to back off (rate limit)"
msgstr "mai sarrafawa ya nemi abokan ciniki su ja da baya (iyakar yawan buƙatu)"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the server answered 304 to a request that was not conditional; previous data kept"
msgstr "sabar ta amsa da 304 ga buƙatar da ba ta da sharaɗi; an riƙe bayanan baya"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the plugin refused a call outside its allowlist"
msgstr "plugin ɗin ya ƙi kira da ke wajen jerin waɗanda aka yarda da su"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the call failed"
msgstr "kiran ya gaza"

#: lib/ErrorClass.php
msgid "the reader ran out of memory; lower Maximum Answer Size or raise Collection Memory in Settings"
msgstr "mai karatu ya ƙare da ƙwaƙwalwar ajiya; rage Matsakaicin Girman Amsa ko ƙara Ƙwaƙwalwar Tattara Bayanai a Saituna"

