#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Matsakaicin Girman Amsa shi ne %d MiB, amma amsar da aka warware mai wannan girman ba ta shiga cikin Ƙwaƙwalwar Tattara Bayanai ta %d MiB ba; mai karatu yana ba da damar %d MiB. Ƙara Ƙwaƙwalwar Tattara Bayanai ko rage Matsakaicin Girman Amsa a Saituna."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "An sanya wa mai tattara bayanai %d, mai tattara bayanai na nesa. Wannan fitowar tana tattarawa ne a kan babban mai tattara bayanai kaɗai, saboda haka ba a tattara rukunin ba; an shirya tattarawa ta nesa don mataki na 3. Sanya shi ga babban mai tattara bayanai."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Tazarar tattara bayanan tana ƙasa da mafi ƙarancin daƙiƙa %d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Tazarar tattara bayanai ta daƙiƙoƙi %d ta fi tazarar mai tattara bayanai ta daƙiƙoƙi %d gajarta; ana tattara bayanai a kowane daƙiƙoƙi %d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
