#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Mai Fassarar Bayanai (Data Parser)"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Mai fassarar bayanai na Slurm don umarnin abokin ciniki. Zaɓi wanda sigar kowane cluster da ake karantawa ta umarnin abokin ciniki take da shi: v0.0.43 yana cikin 25.05, 25.11, da 26.05 kuma an cire shi a 27.05; v0.0.44 yana buƙatar 25.11 ko sama da haka; v0.0.45 yana buƙatar 26.05 ko sama da haka. Shafin lafiya yana yin gargaɗi lokacin da wani cluster ya ba da rahoton sigar da ba ta da shi. Clusters da ake karantawa ta slurmrestd suna watsi da wannan saitin: suna amfani da mafi sabunta daga cikin waɗannan da daemon ɗin ke bayarwa, kuma shafin lafiya yana nuna wanne ne."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar fayil zuwa squeue a kan kowane poller da ke karanta cluster ta umarnin abokin ciniki. Plugin ɗin yana gudanar da shi ne kawai a matsayin squeue --all --json tare da mai fassarar bayanai na sama."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar fayil zuwa scontrol. Plugin ɗin yana gudanar da scontrol --json show node, show partition, da show reservation ne kawai; ba ya taɓa gudanar da update, reconfigure, ko token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar fayil zuwa sshare, ana amfani da ita ne kawai don clusters da ke tattara fair-share."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Iyakoki"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Lokacin Ƙarewar Kira"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da kiran mai tsara ayyuka (scheduler) guda ɗaya zai iya ɗauka kafin a dakatar da shi kuma a yi rajistar ɓangarensa a matsayin wanda ya gaza. Haka kuma kira ba zai taɓa wuce ƙayyadadden lokacin mai karantawa ba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Amsa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "Yawan MiB da kiran scheduler guda ɗaya zai iya mayarwa. Duk amsar da ta fi girma ana watsar da ita kuma ana yin rajistar ɓangarenta a matsayin wanda ya gaza. Fassarawa tana buƙatar kusan ninki 12 na girman amsar, don haka mai karantawa yana amfani da mafi yawa (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB kuma shafin lafiya yana yin gargaɗi lokacin da wannan ƙimar ta fi girma."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Ƙwaƙwalwar Tattarawa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "Yawan MiB na ƙwaƙwalwar PHP da kowane zagayen tattarawa ke ɗaga iyakarsa zuwa gare ta (ba ya taɓa ragewa). Tsohon saiti na 1024 ya dace da amsoshi har zuwa 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar fayil zuwa prlimit (util-linux), ana amfani da ita don iyakance sararin adireshi na kowane umarnin abokin ciniki. Bar shi fanko don gudanar da umarni ba tare da iyakar ƙwaƙwalwa ba; shafin lafiya zai yi gargaɗi a lokacin."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙwaƙwalwar Umarni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "Yawan MiB na sararin adireshi da kowane umarnin abokin ciniki zai iya amfani da shi, ta hanyar prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Takardun Shaidar slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Foldodin Fayilolin Token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Cikakkun foldodi (directories) a kan pollers da za su iya riƙe fayilolin token na slurmrestd, waɗanda aka raba su da waƙafi ko sarari. Cluster zai iya ambaton fayil ɗin token ne kawai da ke cikin ɗayansu, wanda mai amfani na poller ya mallaka kuma aka isa gare shi ba tare da hanyar haɗi ta alama (symbolic link) ba. Kula kowace folda ta kasance mai rubutu ne kawai ga root da mai amfani na poller. Barin fanko yana nufin babu wani cluster da zai iya amfani da slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Masu Masaukin slurmrestd (Hosts)"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Na zaɓi. Masu masaukin slurmrestd da cluster zai iya ambata, a matsayin host ko host:port, waɗanda aka raba su da waƙafi ko sarari. Shigarwa ba tare da port ba tana ba da damar kowace port a kan wancan mai masaukin. Fanko yana ba da damar kowane mai masauki."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙi kafin token ya ƙare lokacin da shafin lafiya zai fara gargaɗi, idan token ɗin yana ɗauke da lokacin ƙarewa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Gargaɗin Ƙarewar Token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓe shi, cire plugin ɗin zai adana clusters ɗinsa da hotunan bayanai (snapshots). Share shi don cirewar ta goge su; fitar da clusters ɗin da farko daga HPC Clusters. Plugin ɗin ba ya ƙirƙirar na'urorin Cacti ko jadawalin Maint a wannan fitowar, kuma ba a taɓa tuntuɓar mai tsara ayyuka ta kowace hanya ba."

