msgid "readable by every user on the poller; restrict it to the poller user (chmod 600)"
msgstr "kowane mai amfani a kan poller yana iya karantawa; ƙuntata shi ga mai amfani na poller kawai (chmod 600)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: owned by a user other than the poller user (chown it to the poller user)"
msgstr "an ƙi: wani mai amfani ne daban da mai amfani na poller ya mallake shi (yi chown nasa zuwa ga mai amfani na poller)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "missing or not readable by the poller user"
msgstr "ya ɓace ko kuma mai amfani na poller ba ya iya karanta shi"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: outside the token file directories set in Settings, reached through a symbolic link, not a regular file, writable by others, or too large; the log names the reason"
msgstr "an ƙi: yana wajen foldodin fayilolin token da aka saita a cikin Settings, an isa gare shi ta hanyar haɗi ta alama (symbolic link), ba fayil na yau da kullun ba ne, wasu suna iya rubutawa a ciki, ko kuma ya yi girma da yawa; rajista (log) ta ambaci dalilin"

